<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: champions and equipment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Activate the four god-tower gongs, defeat their champions and place the heads at the Temple to unlock Pack-a-Punch.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Build the Brazen Bull shield. Complete the Death of Orion acquisition route or obtain the weapon from the box, then upgrade it to Serket’s Kiss.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-3" data-guide-step>Complete arena challenges and prepare a Firebomb weapon for the Danu activation.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-danu">Danu preparation</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-danu-1" data-guide-step>Obtain the special skull in the Temple and grind it using the wonder weapon. Collect wood from the pyre and dung from poor crowd affinity.</li>
<li id="guide-step-danu-2" data-guide-step>Burn the wood in the cauldron, collect the ash when ready and mix the fertilizer ingredients. Track full waiting rounds and inspect the result before collection.</li>
<li id="guide-step-danu-3" data-guide-step>Place the fertilizer at Danu, use Firebomb at the required spot and complete the tree defense after the activation.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="bo4-ix-danu" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-ra">Ra enemy sequence</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-ra-1" data-guide-step>Find and shoot the four bull symbols using the shield, then kill the summoned champions to charge the obelisk.</li>
<li id="guide-step-ra-2" data-guide-step>Read the obelisk display and identify each enemy symbol. Kill the required special enemies in displayed order during the challenge; avoid accidentally killing a later target first.</li>
<li id="guide-step-ra-3" data-guide-step>Clear the recorder before the next sequence and repeat until Ra’s challenge is complete.</li></ol><InlineTool tool="bo4-ix-ra" /></section>
<section><h2 id="details-zeus">Zeus and Odin</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-zeus-1" data-guide-step>Raise the required posts and charge them with Kill-O-Watt kills. Complete the arena challenge and return to the quest route.</li>
<li id="guide-step-zeus-2" data-guide-step>Shoot the nine Odin symbols in their three alignment groups from the correct viewing positions, then complete the pit defense.</li>
<li id="guide-step-zeus-3" data-guide-step>Resupply before interacting with the final quest portal.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-boss">Elephant bosses</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-boss-1" data-guide-step>Damage and break each elephant’s armor to expose vulnerable areas, then focus fire while avoiding charges and supporting enemies.</li>
<li id="guide-step-boss-2" data-guide-step>Defeat both elephants; the first kill is only the midpoint of the encounter.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Original concise walkthrough adapted from the sources below. Research reviewed 2026-09-30. Use their illustrated references for exact object sightlines. Gameplay verification is ongoing.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/CODZombies/wiki/ix/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">r/CODZombies community guide ↗</a></li></ul></section></div></template>
